companion cell (`prelude.cljc:1653-1714`: `js.rt/retained-seal` + a\n   525\t   wrapper-identity back-reference), not the VM's provenance doors. Same leg for\n   526\t   `:yang/call-site` → `#{}`, pinning that C1 is compile-time frontend metadata and never a\n   527\t   guest-readable definition.\n   528\t3. **Completeness of the audited surface.** `prelude/module-exports` is exactly the\n   529\t   `js`-namespaced keys of `prelude/definitions` (so the internal `js.rt/*` store keys are\n   530\t   provably not exported), and `hooks/module-exports` is exactly `hooks/function-definitions`\n   531\t   stripped — the latter mirroring `linked_prelude_test.cljc:87-88`'s existing pin. Leg 3 is\n   532\t   what makes legs 1-2 an audit of the whole surface rather than a sample.\n   533\t\n   534\tPre-verified statically so these are green by construction, not by hope: `grep dsg__` over\n   535\t`src/cljc/yang/typescript/` returns exactly one hit — my own new comment at\n   536\t`lower.cljc:2278`; `grep provenance` over `src/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc`\n   537\treturns exactly one hit, a comment at `:1669`.\n   538\t\n   539\t---\n   540\t\n   541\t## 7. The four judgement calls needing the orchestrator's ruling\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
